demy-id "q-69661" :question/problem "If\n$S=[\\begin{aligned}1-p & 1+p \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}]$\nand $det(S)=2$, what is the value of $p?$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S) & =|\\begin{aligned}1-p & 1+p \\\\ -3 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(1-p)\\cdot 2-(1+p)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =2-2p+3+3p \\\\  & =5+p\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(S)=2$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S) & =2 \\\\ 5+p & =2 \\\\ p & =2-5 \\\\ p & =-3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-69661/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-69661"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127601/selection/192541b326ad66e26d174d72b6038c1a1403a87688d499531df6883c0ca299ab" :answer/id #uuid "21043a29-87b5-5326-b3e1-0cb49b873355" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{3xy}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127601/selection/c7be00d2ea93497b8f2934356ff3919efb533c2c59e9d1a3bb220d57612708c2" :answer/id #uuid "a77ddd3d-4f35-5c3b-a420-2f0328fb3aef" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5xy" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127601/selection/265d8664e4e01035bfe6d2dc22a00b8f11a66e071aec00a91439a3c6618dcf38" :answer/id #uuid "cf2ef6df-8e8b-5ae4-810d-15e1fc1bf9e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4xy" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127601/selection/26758ab11440066883410a70fdb9f45de53de34bdb7db07cbf901df3874ec355" :answer/id #uuid "3fb0d106-49bc-57e2-bc8e-5321f1e7948f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5xy" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127601/selection/46bb7e3768d84d2d6f41a48fd02cca1670dc9bc953d0468c8bfcd1bbb3a21b09" :answer/id #uuid "7dd672f2-fa4d-5e65-871b-1ef