a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(D) & =|\\begin{aligned}2x & y \\\\ -5 & xy\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2x\\cdot xy-y\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =2{x}^{2}y+5y \\\\  & =y(2{x}^{2}+5)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127603/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e8a6ff-e5ed-59a7-b31d-1981495bf26a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127603"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127606/selection/41e45661b60d261a031b427321923ed87cc6966026d1741c2478c81f650b13fb" :answer/id #uuid "b2a6b859-b6fa-5b98-8477-5726c47f9c7e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v=\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127606/selection/f162ee8a34bd2176b9562f17a55f91170809e6728bd5c713242f434d2c9a7f32" :answer/id #uuid "aeedcd66-f4ba-5455-a801-1d0e3aa65f78" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v=\\frac{7}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127606/selection/6e1c627c665d1c133fab1fdc0c27b36932bfb5a3f4fbea57d6de0b0ffd7fd85b" :answer/id #uuid "93ff7f4a-4099-50cf-8e61-d187fdbe9ef4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v=4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127606/selection/38f8b2d29f9208cc4729b5f1d4e75121874b0f95abf73b275e28a1cd58060ced" :answer/id #uuid "d29fc6c6-ed22-5328-b095-d23bdef0df1e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v=-2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127606/selection/a48e7c8c63373e7becadf40015366bac518a8608d33bcd38e762494b2a70ba87" :answer/id #uuid "ee36df99-e3e5-5272-9b4d-a0f74effa7bd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "v=-3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127606/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "5eb19b20-3a6d-5ef4-a9cf-64f356088b82" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127606/selection/38f8b2d29f9208cc4729b5f1d4e75121874b0f95abf73b275e28a1cd58060ced" :answer-field/choices ["q-127606/selection/41e45661b60d261a031b427321923ed87cc6966026d1741c2478c81f650b13fb" "q-127606/selection/f162ee8a34bd2176b9562f17a55f91170809e6728bd5c713242f434d2c9a7f32" "q-127606/selection/6e1c627c665d1c133fab1fdc0c27b36932bfb5a3f4fbea57d6de0b0ffd7fd85b" "q-127606/selection/38f8b2d29f9208cc4729b5f1d4e75121874b0f95abf73b275e28a1cd58060ced" "q-127606/selection/a48e7c8c63373e7becadf40015366bac518a8608d33bcd38e762494b2a70ba87"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127606" :question/id #uuid "25fa2f42-3a0c-5274-a75f-53c4c844a01f" :question/math-academy-id "q-127606" :question/problem "If\n$T=[\\begin{aligned}v & 2v \\\\ 2 & v+8\\end{aligned}]$\nand $det(T)=-4$, what is the value of $v?$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(T) & =|\\begin{aligned}v & 2v \\\\ 2 & v+8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =v\\cdot (v+8)-2v\\cdot 2 \\\\  & ={v}^{2}+4v\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(T)=-4$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(T) & =-4 \\\\ {v}^{2}+4v & =-4 \\\\ {v}^{2}+4v+4 & =0 \\\\ (v+2)^{2} & =0 \\\\ v & =-2\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127606/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127606"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-317374/field-1/4038e3661c66cbc91c40c34c5f579013aa1fdc893e20adf188afaa146f088405" :answer/id #uuid "2721fb1b-944f-514b-9459-32c248390c5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6-4y" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-317374/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "9689caa6-d67d-586d-afb2-3478b2ba698d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-317374/field-1/4038e3661c66cbc91c40c34c5f579013aa1fdc893e20adf188afaa146f088405" :answer-field/choices ["q-317374/field-1/4038e3661c66cbc91c40c34c5f579013aa1fdc893e20adf188afaa146f088405"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-317374" :question/id #uuid "31f29a1f-5ce7-5787-80e1-70b0610804ac" :question/math-academy-id "q-317374" :question/problem "Evaluate the determinant:\n\n$|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{6} & y \\\\ 4 & \\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}|=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}|\\begin{aligned}\\sqrt{6} & y \\\\ 4 & \\sqrt{6}\\end{aligned}| & =\\sqrt{6}\\cdot \\sqrt{6}-y\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =6-4y.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-317374/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "26e8a6ff-e5ed-59a7-b31d-1981495bf26a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-317374"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
